/* Energy history recovery */
"原文件不会在本次加载中被覆盖。" = "The original file will not be overwritten during this load.";
"原数据已复制为 %@。" = "The original data was copied to %@.";
"能耗历史来自不受支持的版本，%@" = "The energy history uses an unsupported version. %@";
"原文件未被覆盖。" = "The original file was not overwritten.";
"能耗历史无法读取，%@ %@" = "The energy history could not be read. %@ %@";
"Charker 能耗导出：数值由 Charker 在本机对 BLE 遥测做时间积分推算。" = "Charker energy export: values are integrated over time from BLE telemetry on this Mac.";
"充电器不提供能量账本，这些是观测推算值，不是设备读数。" = "The charger keeps no energy ledger; these are values derived from observation, not device readings.";
"Charker 未运行或未连接的时间是空洞，不计入，也不补值。" = "Time when Charker was not running or not connected is a gap: neither counted nor filled in.";
"文件只含时间与功率/能量聚合值，不含序列号、MAC 或账号信息。" = "The file holds only timestamps and power/energy aggregates — no serial number, MAC address, or account information.";
"%@ 之前的 %d 段连接旅程已折叠为汇总，能量与时长仍计入小时/日/月桶，但不再单独成行。" = "Connection journeys before %@ — %d of them — have been folded into summaries; their energy and duration still count toward the hourly, daily, and monthly buckets, but they no longer appear as individual rows.";
"系统时间（%@）远超存档里最新一条记录（%@），已跳过本次历史裁剪，未删除任何数据。请检查 Mac 的日期与时间。" = "The system clock (%@) is far ahead of the newest record in the archive (%@). History trimming was skipped and nothing was deleted. Check this Mac's date and time.";

