/* Cover transfer */
"没有可推送的图像数据。" = "There is no image data to push.";
"图片太大：需要 %d 片，超出协议能表示的上限。" = "The image is too large: it needs %d slices, more than the protocol can address.";
"上一次封面推送还没结束。" = "The previous cover push has not finished.";
"推送前必须先确认：写进充电器的封面没有任何删除命令，只能被之后的推送挤掉。" = "You must confirm before pushing: a cover written to the charger has no delete command, and can only be evicted by a later push.";
"两条命令描述的不是同一张图（选图命令的 hash 与图片本身对不上），已在发出任何字节前停下。" = "The two commands describe different images: the select command’s hash does not match the picture itself. Stopped before sending a single byte.";
"充电器没有回应选图命令。" = "The charger did not answer the select-cover command.";
"充电器拒绝了这张封面（状态 0x%02X）。已知 0x11 表示云端有这张图、机内还没有像素。" = "The charger refused this cover (status 0x%02X). 0x11 is known to mean the image exists in the cloud but its pixels are not on the device yet.";
"充电器没有回应起传命令，本次一个字节都没写进去。" = "The charger did not answer the start-transfer command; not one byte was written.";
"充电器拒绝了起传（状态 0x%02X），本次一个字节都没写进去。" = "The charger refused the start of the transfer (status 0x%02X); not one byte was written.";
"第 %d 片没能发出去。" = "Slice %d could not be sent.";
"等第 %d 片的回执超时。" = "Timed out waiting for the acknowledgement of slice %d.";
"充电器在第 %d 片报错（状态 0x%02X）。" = "The charger reported an error on slice %d (status 0x%02X).";
"进度对不上：我们发到第 %d 片，充电器说它只收到第 %d 片，中间丢了。" = "Progress does not line up: we sent through slice %d, the charger says it only has slice %d — the ones between were lost.";
"已停在第 %d / %d 片。已经写进充电器的片撤不回来。" = "Stopped at slice %d of %d. The slices already written to the charger cannot be taken back.";
"推送超时，停在第 %d / %d 片。" = "The push timed out at slice %d of %d.";
"读不到" = "unreadable";
"像素已经发完，但充电器报告的封面还是 %@，不是 %d。" = "All pixels went out, but the charger still reports cover %@ rather than %d.";
"正在推送封面" = "Pushing a cover";

/* 握手失败 — 说后果和下一步，证据只进 diagnostics；端口倒计时的拒绝 */
"这一版只能给端口设定倒计时时长，还不能取消已经设定的倒计时。" = "This build can only set a port countdown; it cannot cancel one that is already set.";
"屏幕亮度只能设为 25% 到 100%。" = "Screen brightness can only be set from 25% to 100%.";
"充电器在「%@」这一步没有回应，连接没能建立。可以再试一次；靠近一点，并确认官方 Anker App 没有占用它。" = "The charger did not answer at the “%@” step, so the connection was not established. Try again — move closer, and make sure the official Anker app is not holding it.";
"充电器没有接受「%@」。数据照常能读，但控制类操作可能会被拒绝。" = "The charger did not accept “%@”. Readings still come through, but control commands may be refused.";
"连接在「%@」这一步断了，原因不明。可以再试一次；靠近一点，并确认官方 Anker App 没有占用它。" = "The connection dropped at the “%@” step, for a reason nothing on this end can see. Try again — move closer, and make sure the official Anker app is not holding it.";
"充电器在「%@」这一步拒绝了连接。可以再试一次；如果每次都停在这里，把充电器断电重新通电再连。" = "The charger refused the connection at the “%@” step. Try again; if it stops here every time, unplug the charger, power it back up and reconnect.";
"充电器在「%@」这一步的回复不完整，连接没能建立。请再试一次。" = "The charger’s reply at the “%@” step was incomplete, so the connection was not established. Try again.";
"没能和充电器协商出加密通道，连接没能建立。请再试一次；如果一直失败，把蓝牙关掉再打开。" = "No encrypted channel could be negotiated with the charger, so the connection was not established. Try again; if it keeps failing, switch Bluetooth off and back on.";
"连接在「%@」这一步乱了次序，没能建立。请重新连接。" = "The connection went out of order at the “%@” step and was not established. Reconnect.";
